<Slide notes={`把校验往前放，是这套保护里最重要的一条。

收到工具请求，先不要执行，先做一次执行前检查：预算还剩多少、call_id 是否成对、参数是否在允许范围内、工具名字是否在允许列表里。检查走完，才分三路。

可执行的，调用只读函数；可回传的输入错误，返回诊断；触发停止条件的，直接停下并保留原因。真正执行和受控错误，最后都会走到同一步：记录并回传。

还有两条限制要单独说。教学上限是八轮模型响应、十六条进入处理的工具请求，计数在参数解析与执行前递增，不是成功执行的次数。同一个函数和同一组参数累计出现第三次，就在执行前拦下来，标记为未执行，这样两个工具交替重复也能被发现。`} style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 64px' }}>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 44, background: '#276FBF' }} />
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.5.4　参数错误、工具失败与无进展</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>执行前校验与无进展阻断</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 20px', height: 56 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#CB6B28' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#20344B' }}>教学上限：8 轮模型响应、16 条工具请求，计数在执行前递增，非成功执行数。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 554, height: 96, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>收到工具请求</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>名称与 JSON 参数</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 96, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 26, color: '#276FBF' }}>›</Text></Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 554, height: 96, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>执行前检查</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>预算、call_id、参数与允许列表</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 26, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#26816B' }}>↓</Text></Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 24 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 130, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>可执行</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>符合执行条件</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>调用只读函数</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 130, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>可回传的输入错误</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>未知工具或非法参数</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>拒绝任意执行，返回诊断</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 360, height: 130, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779' }}>停止条件</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>预算耗尽或无进展</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>停止并保留原因</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 1104, height: 72, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>记录并回传：真实数据或受控错误</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 1104, height: 64, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>同一函数与参数累计第 3 次，在执行前拦截：not_executed</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>2.5 Function Calling</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#546779' }}>20 / 26</Text>
    </Box>

</Slide>
